{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-cost-guard",
  "version": "0.1.8",
  "description": "成本守卫：对 DeepSeek V4-Flash-0731 纯 API 计价的省钱插件——按官方 2026-08-17 峰谷费率核算会话成本、缓存命中率与全命中可省金额；¥ 预算守卫（超支近场引导）；峰谷感知与错峰队列（cost_defer daemon 空闲时段自动执行）；收敛/深度/错峰引导注入。零依赖，前缀缓存中性，宿主平面装配在现有 preset/mode-boost 之上。",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./core": {
      "default": "./lib/core.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "preset",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc <5"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "bash scripts/build.sh || true"
  }
}
